{"id": 1653139, "title": "DOR [Crack is included] [English]", "magnet": "magnet:?xt=urn:btih:44659e9e68828619c17c71b6cad89a9f3aa59f51&dn=DOR%20%5BCrack%20is%20included%5D%20%5BEnglish%5D&tr=http%3A%2F%2Fsukebei.tracker.wf%3A8888%2Fannounce&tr=udp%3A%2F%2Fopen.stealth.si%3A80%2Fannounce&tr=udp%3A%2F%2Ftracker.opentrackr.org%3A1337%2Fannounce&tr=udp%3A%2F%2Fexodus.desync.com%3A6969%2Fannounce&tr=udp%3A%2F%2Ftracker.torrent.eu.org%3A451%2Fannounce", "info_hash": "44659e9e68828619c17c71b6cad89a9f3aa59f51", "uploaded_at": "2015-03-23T22:28:00+00:00", "seeders": 0, "leechers": 0, "category": "Art-Games", "submitter": "NyaaTorrents", "information": "No information.", "size": "0 Bytes", "description": "![Image](http://s6.postimg.org/wxvq28vi9/gj_PS0_Lbx_X9.jpg)  \n  \nTitle: DOR  \nYear: Japan 1992-02-28, English Version 2002-07-02  \nLength: Very short (< 2 hours)  \nDeveloper: D.O.  \nPublishers: G-Collections  \nLanguage: English  \nVoice: Japanese  \n  \nDescription:  \n![Image](http://s6.postimg.org/sq5j78jgh/Volt_L3_Qyj4.jpg)  \n  \nThere is a door in front of you... A strange door, which has been created by the Devil. On the other side of it, three different worlds await you. Don't be scared, but don't get caught up in the realms of fantasy! The Devil is waiting to lead you along...  \n  \n[Kanako's Depression / 加奈子さんの憂鬱](https://vndb.org/v9167)  \nYou don't have a girlfriend, and you don't have any money either. You're moping around in your apartment, when a girl suddenly shows up at your door. Her name is Kanako; she's a timid little thing, but wait until you find out what she really is...!  \n  \n[The Telephone Scandal / テレホンスキャンダル](https://vndb.org/v9169)  \nYou want to have a girlfriend. You call a dating service and guess what!? You get a girl and go out on a date. Wait a minute... Is this girl...?  \n  \nArmored Fighter Gyleban  \nThe evil organization of Gill Grauber tries to dominate the world. One man stands against their nightmarish plans and challanges them. His name is Ryosei Motosu, a selfish bastard... People call him the Armored Fighter Gyleban!   \n  \nImportant:  \n1. Mount DOR.cue with Daemon Tools.  \n2. Install the game.  \n3. Copy the file from folder crack in the virtual disk drive and place it in the game directory.  \n  \nSystem Requirements:  \nCPU: Pentium 133MHz or higher  \nMemory: 32MB or higher  \nGraphic: Display at high color or higher  \n  \nScreenshots:  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/02/20202.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/95/20195.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/99/20199.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/97/20197.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/93/20193.jpg)"}
